1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
What’s new in Island Time 1.22.3, shown with mock game data.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:09,000
The title screen’s Start a new week button is now Start a new game.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,500
Your saved game stays in its save slot.

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:18,000
It asks how you want to play: live on the island, visit, or be a weekend regular.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,500
The weekly and daily challenges are in the list too.

6
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:27,000
Each choice then asks its own questions, like how long you’ll stay.

7
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,500
The separate Visit the island button is gone; it’s one of the choices now.

8
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:36,000
Seattle gets its own map tab, on the real shoreline.

9
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,500
It’s about fifty-five minutes up I-5 from the Steilacoom ferry, and longer in rush hour.

10
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:45,000
Eat at Ivar’s on the waterfront or Dick’s Drive-In on Capitol Hill.

11
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:49,500
Then wander Pike Place Market, go up the Space Needle, or visit MOPOP.

12
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:55,000
Play free in your browser at krazow.github.io/islandtime

